      "name": "RainCap",
      "slug": "raincap",
      "teaser": "A mod which lets you reduce/disable the rain drops on your screen when wearing a cap",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/onncgmh4tPBZBVTTC9w754JvijejOa1EnqS7Xeqo.png",
      "downloads": 666,
      "favourites_count": 5,
      "description": "<h2>Description</h2>\n<p>This mod allows you to reduce the rain drops on your screen if you are wearing a forward facing cap with a brim as if you were wearing glasses, or disable it altogether when the cap is on.</p>\n<h2>Config</h2>\n<p>The config can be found in the BepInEx menu under <code>F12</code>, the only option is to toggle the caps  to prevent the rain drops altogether</p>\n<h2>Mod compatibility</h2>\n<p>The only caps which should work with this mod are the ones from WTT-Backport as their IDs are the same as live.</p>\n",
